events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SysError99/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SysError99/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T15:59:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T15:59:29Z","body":">  Not sure if we want to keep the issues open for `3.x` or what.\r\n\r\nWhile the reproduction is indeed made with 3.5.3 (which is the version I've been actively using), the issue itself does not specifically mention `3.x` branch and also does apply up to the `master` before it gets patched. I'd say it's fair to close it since the current, actively developed, is `4.x`. I could probably open the issue again for the `3.x` but this is fairly easy to port, might as well skip the issue-opening completely and just do the backport directly.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3715261834/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3715417853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112401#issuecomment-3715417853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112401","id":3715417853,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ddMb9","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu